  "paper_framing": "Use as supplement-level over-window boundary evidence. The balanced full LongBench-v2 >500k diagnostic shows that cheap retrieval/rerank routes are feasible and low-cost, but not reliable enough to close the RLM-favorable extreme-context region. It should calibrate, not replace, the existing LB2 pilot."
